                "text": "By 'last year' I can use:\n\u2022 L12M \u2014 trailing 12 months from today\n\u2022 CY2024 \u2014 Jan 1 to Dec 31 2024\n\u2022 FY2024 \u2014 your fiscal year 2024\n\u2022 BY2024 \u2014 your business year 2024\nWhich do you prefer?"
